1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Breathlines is a writing desk.
Your breath sets the line breaks.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Consent first: camera estimates,
not medical measurements. Telemetry stays off.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:16,500
Pick and rotate your camera, then run
SmartSpectra three point five device readiness.

4
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:19,400
This test camera is inconclusive.

5
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:26,000
The face is a Creative Commons interview clip,
used as a stand-in webcam.

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,500
SmartSpectra processes its signals in real time.

7
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:33,000
Type without Enter. Each exhale ends a line
at a word boundary,

8
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:35,000
carrying unfinished words forward.

9
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:41,000
The live panel shows the chest waveform,
pulse, and breathing rate.

10
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:45,000
The margin records pulse, breaths,
expression, and talking.

11
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:49,000
A double blink or long eye closure
can request a new stanza.

12
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:52,500
Click Stop.
Camera off, writing preserved.

13
00:00:52,500 --> 00:01:02,000
Export to HTML or PNG
when you're ready to save.
